urname>Roche</surname><given-names>PC</given-names></name><name><surname>Burgart</surname><given-names>LJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Thibodeau</surname><given-names>SN</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Hypermethylation of the hMLH1 promoter in colon cancer with microsatellite instability</article-title><source>Cancer Res</source><year>1998</year><volume>58</volume><fpage>3455</fpage><lpage>3460</lpage><!--PubMed citation query: 'Cancer Res||58|3455||bib6|'--><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">9699680</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib7"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>da Costa</surname><given-names>LT</given-names></name><name><surname>Liu</surname><given-names>B</given-names></name><name><surname>el-Deiry</surname><given-names>W</given-names></name><name><surname>Hamilton</surname><given-names>SR</given-names></name><name><surname>Kinzler</surname><given-names>KW</given-names></name><name><surname>Vogelstein</surname><given-names>B</given-names></name><name><surname>Markowitz</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Willson</surname><given-names>JK</given-names></name><name><surname>de la Chapelle</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Downey</surname><given-names>KM</given-names></name><name><surname>So</surname><given-names>AG</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Polymerase <italic>&#x003b4;</italic> variants in RER colorectal tumours</article-title><source>Nat Genet</source><year>1995</year><volume>9</volume><fpage>10</fpage><lpage>11</lpage><!--PubMed citation query: 'Nat Genet||9|10||bib7|'--><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">7704014</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib8"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Delattre</surname><given-names>O</given-names></name><name><surname>Olschwang</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Law</surname><given-names>DJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Melot</surname><given-names>T</given-names></name><name><surname>Remvilos</surname><given-names>Y</given-names></name><name><surname>Salmon</surname><given-names>RJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Sastre</surname><given-names>X</given-names></name><name><surname>Validire</surname><given-names>P</given-names></name><name><surname>Feinberg</surname><given-names>AP</given-names></name><name><surname>Thomas</surname><given-names>G</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Multiple genetic alterations in distal and proximal colorectal cancer</article-title><source>Lancet</source><year>1989</year><volume>2</volume><supplement>8659</supplement><fpage>353</fpage><lpage>356</lpage><!--PubMed citation query: 'Lancet||2|353||bib8|'--></citation></ref><ref id="bib9"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Dietmaier</surname><given-names>W</given-names></name><name><surname>Wallinger</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Bocker</surname><given-names>T</given-names></name><name><surname>Kullmann</surname><given-names>F</given-names></name><name><surname>Fishel</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name><name><surname>R&#x000fc;schoff</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Diagnostic microsatellite instability: definition and correlation with mismatch repair protein expression</article-title><source>Cancer Res</source><year>1997</year><volume>57</volume><fpage>4749</fpage><lpage>4756</lpage><!--PubMed citation query: 'Cancer Res||57|4749||bib9|'--><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">9354436</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib10"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Dix</surname><given-names>B</given-names></name><name><surname>Robbins</surname><given-names>P</given-names></name><name><surname>Carrello</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>House</surname><given-names>A</given-names>